    "beginners": "Dedicated beginner zones at M\u00e9ribel Centre and Mottaret. Green runs from the Olympic Park area.",
    "intermediates": "Exceptional \u2014 43% blue, 24% red. Platti\u00e8res to Tougn\u00e8te area is paradise for cruisers. Long red runs from top of Saulire. Best intermediates terrain in the Three Valleys.",
